# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .dockerignore — kanban-collaboration-server
#
# Goal: keep the build context small AND keep secrets out of the
# image. Rule of thumb — anything the image REBUILDS or REGENERATES
# should be excluded, because it comes back inside the container
# anyway. Excluding it just makes the build faster and the image
# smaller.
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Dependencies — reinstalled in the image (npm ci) ─────────────
node_modules
**/node_modules

# ── Build output — rebuilt by `npm run build` ────────────────────
dist
**/dist
*.tsbuildinfo

# ── Test coverage & lint caches ──────────────────────────────────
coverage
.nyc_output
.eslintcache

# ── Runtime artefacts — created at runtime, never shipped ────────
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
# Yjs / LevelDB persistence (regenerated on boot)
*.db
data

# ── Secrets — MUST NOT enter the image ───────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── Version control & CI ─────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github

# ── Docker plumbing — not needed inside the image ────────────────
Dockerfile
Dockerfile.*
docker-compose*.yml
.dockerignore

# ── Editor / IDE ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode
.idea
*.swp
*.swo

# ── OS junk ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── Docs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.md
!README.md

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OPTIONAL — uncomment for a slimmer PRODUCTION image.
#
# Only enable this if your Dockerfile's builder stage does NOT run
# the test suite (npm test / npm run verify). If it does, the build
# will FAIL, because those files won't be in the context.
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# tests
# **/*.test.ts
# **/*.spec.ts
# **/__tests__
# **/__mocks__
# jest.config.*